Description: The ssh_config option NoHostAuthenticationForProxyCommand
 With it set to yes, ssh accepts the host key of a connection made
 through a ProxyCommand.
Origin: https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions/OpenSSH/tree/OpenSSH-354.120.2
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-11

